\title{BinomialEgidiMixture class}
\description{
The empirical robust mixture prior of Egidi et al. (2022) for a
binary endpoint, on the components of \link{BinomialRMP}: for each dataset, the
weight of the weak component is the smallest on the grid at which the
prior-predictive conflict p-value of the observed counts reaches
\code{alpha_pc}, the p-value being computed exactly from the components'
prior-predictive tables (see \code{\link[=egidi_select_weak_weight_binomial]{egidi_select_weak_weight_binomial()}}).
}
